  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.7/client-server-api/#room-previews\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nThe spec mentions \"peeking\" several times in the C-S API, but it never really defines what peeking is. https://spec.matrix.org/v1.7/client-server-api/#room-previews mentions \"lurking\" but not peeking.\r\n\r\nI suggest adding the text in bold:\r\n\r\n> It is sometimes desirable to offer a preview of a room, where a user can “lurk” and read messages posted to the room, without joining the room. **This behaviour is sometimes referred to as \"peeking\"**.",
